From: Ian Blenke <ian@blenke.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 22:13:56 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 07726/11362] [outer-loop] ARC E3 search A/B = robust null:
 perception-target routing does not convert to discovery (REQ-ARC-WMTE-5835)

Fed a perception-derived target into Carnot's LLM-free value-head-routed explorer;
A/B vs default, 8 games. 0 discovery both arms, robust across search mode. The
value_head engages but player->target distance never decreases -- the search doesn't
navigate to the target. Combined with the greedy-direct null (5834): perception fix
is validated but neither architecture executes it into a solved level out of the box.
Execution/navigation is a hard, separate problem. Bounds the perception-fix program
honestly: wall moved from perception/goal to execution/navigation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
